{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1359419-1001-spirits","id":1359419,"title":"1001 Spirits","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-01-06T22:39:21-08:00","id":1359419,"title":"1001 Spirits","content":"So could not find topic with Search button for spirits sharing and creation - so started one now. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I need to create some Totem and spirits for my game - so here are best ideas for those.<br /> <br /> Now, I do not have idea for first one of them - just that I need one from <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Imperial_Library_of_Constantinople\" target=\"_blank\">Imperial Library of Constantinople</a>, leading pack of Bone Shadows inside. Some spirit connected to libraries or mythical beasts of Greek literature are to be looked for.<br /> <br /> * Powers marked by asterisk are from <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/775-reighnhell\">Reighnhell</a>\u2019s <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993181-twilight-menagerie#post993181\">list of new Manifestations &amp; Numina</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-17-2020, 06:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-06T23:07:44-08:00","id":1359421,"title":"","content":"<b>Re: Spirits</b><br /> <br /> It's been a while since I have made any updates, but here is a link to my thread of <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993181-twilight-menagerie\">Spirits and other ephemeral entities</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1420009-the-artificer-s-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">The Artificer's Workshop</a> - A collection of Exalted Artifacts<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806809-curios-relics-and-tomes\" target=\"_blank\">Curios, Relics, and Tomes</a> - A collection of Relics (Cursed and Otherwise)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/793173-the-horror-show\" target=\"_blank\">The Horror Lab</a> - A collection of Beasts, Monsters and less definable things.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1128197-strange-places#post1128197\" target=\"_blank\">Strange Places</a> - A collection of Dark, Mysterious, and Wondrous Locations<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993181-twilight-menagerie\" target=\"_blank\">Twilight Menagerie</a> - A collection of Ephemeral Entities","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/775-reighnhell","name":"Reighnhell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar775_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"749"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-06T23:27:40-08:00","id":1359423,"title":"","content":"I love your topic, Reighnhell, but was thinking on topic in Werewolf cotext. Like I will prepare few Totems, that you do not prepare normaly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-08T13:37:03-08:00","id":1359770,"title":"","content":"So here is my first take on self-made spirits, to more general use - but also Totems of particular groups.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:18px\"><b>1. Wise Owl</b></span><br /> <br /> Wise Owl is Totem of generational Bone Shadows pack in one of greater libraries. Legend says that Owl is one of those belonging to Athena, from her personal flock. Centuries ago Owl stalked the nights, catching rodents in <i>Hisil</i>. Now it stalks knowledge and lore, wanting to uncover secrets of universe. But as her original goddess, bird still know how to hunt - and how to gauge eyes.<br /> <br /> Wise Owl, beside showing to her pack worshipers, is known to Fetter to precious books, to find new candidates for next generation of her cult, when they take new book to read.<br /> <br /> <b>Rank:</b> 3 (Spirit)<br /> Power 5, Finesse 7, Resistance 5, Willpower 10, Essence 20<br /> <b>Initiative:</b> 15<br /> <b>Defence:</b> 5<br /> <b>Speed:</b> 10<br /> <b>Size:</b> 3<br /> <b>Corpus: </b>8<br /> <b>Influences:</b> Knowledge 3, Owls 2<br /> <b>Ban: </b>Offered new knowledge, Owl cannot refuse<br /> <b>Bane: </b>Snake deceiving others<br /> <b>Manifestation: </b>Reaching, Gauntlet Breach, Image, Materialize, Fetter, Twilight Form<br /> <b>Numina</b>: Aggressive Meme, Implant Mission, Occult Sight*, Omen Trance, Pathfinder, Seek","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-17-2020, 06:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-13T04:07:34-08:00","id":1367480,"title":"","content":"There goes @Wyrmhamster highjacking threads again. At least he's not plagiarizing now. Baby steps.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-27T21:06:05-08:00","id":1370933,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1359419-1001-spirits?p=1367480#post1367480\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There goes @Wyrmhamster highjacking threads again. At least he's not plagiarizing now. Baby steps.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">And how exactly is he hijacking the thread he created? The comment wasn't necessary, please don't do it again.</span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-31T14:03:16-07:00","id":1377572,"title":"","content":"In coming weeks I will fill out my 800s Constantinople setting Hisil with Spirit Rulers &amp; Knights of those area. Here I have basic ideas I have for now \u2013 some guidance are looked for. I will then stat those spirits as examples in this topic.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Byzantine_flags_and_insignia#Single-headed_eagle\" target=\"_blank\">Cisters</a> \u2013 Rat ( What kind it can be? Survivalist Rat? )<br /> Great Palace \u2013 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Byzantine_flags_and_insignia#Single-headed_eagle\" target=\"_blank\">Empire\u2019s Eagle</a> ( Pure &amp; <i>Assembly of Eagles</i> Totem )<br /> Habour \u2013 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Golden_Horn\" target=\"_blank\">Golden Horn</a> \u2013 one of leading city\u2019s spirit, great Golden Crescent from which flows water - &amp; <a href=\"https://www.dailyedge.ie/scary-seagulls-926719-May2013/\" target=\"_blank\">Cunning Seagull</a><br /> Hagia Sophia - <i>He Who Suffer on Cross</i> ( Totem of <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1154238-2e-fan-lodge-of-the-roman-ritual\">Lodge of Roman Ritual</a> )<br /> Hipodrome \u2013 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Serpent_Column\" target=\"_blank\">Three Headed Snake</a> ( <i>Fidia </i>Pack Totem ) &amp; <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Milion\" target=\"_blank\">Milion</a> Stone ( next to Hipodrom )<br /> Imperial Library \u2013 Great-Knower ( Spirit Lord, in form of sentient Library's bookshelf ) &amp; Wise Owl (<i> Cenobites</i> Pack Totem )<br /> Streets \u2013 <a href=\"https://vimeo.com/152779982\" target=\"_blank\">Cats. A LOT of Cats Spirits.</a><br /> Marketplaces \u2013 Cerberus (<i>Publicanis</i> Pack Totem )<br /> Theater \u2013 Pegasus ( <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1174041-2e-wta-tribe-as-wtf-lodge-%E2%80%93-black-furies\">Black Furies Lodge</a> Totem )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-17-2020, 06:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-17T04:06:43-07:00","id":1382114,"title":"","content":"Starting doing spirits for my game, so here is first portion of Spirits Lords. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <b>2. Library - <i>Great-Knower</i></b><br /> <br /> <i>Great-Knower </i>is ruler of Imperial Library\u2019s of Constantinople Hisil. A wall of scrolls with which codices from papyrus and parchment hang, a completely new plumage of a bird that is shedding old feathers. In the central, upper part of the wall there are holes for new papyri, which form the &quot;eyes&quot; and &quot;lips&quot; of this Hisil ruler.<br /> <br /> He is almost single-minded, drive to his main mission of hoarding and sharing knowledge. He needs to exchange one piece of lore for another \u2013giving lore freely is totally unheard of him. Of course, each \u2018knowledge exchange\u2019 is worship ritual for him, from what he get\u2019s his Essence. A bit uncearing, he is like old grandpa to myriads spirits in the Library itself, at the centre of labyrinth that Shadow Realm reflection the place is.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Uo1f31c.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Rank:</b> 4 (Spirit \u2013 <i>Ensah</i>)<br /> <b>Umia:</b> Knowledge<br /> <b>Ilthum:</b> Library ( Scrolls and Books)<br /> Power 12, Finesse 8, Resistance 10<br /> <b>Willpower:</b> 10<br /> <b>Essence:</b> 25<br /> <b>Initiative:</b> 18<br /> <b>Defence:</b> 8<br /> <b>Speed:</b> 0 ( 5 when levitating around Library, but he almost never do this )<br /> <b>Size:</b> 10<br /> <b>Corpus: </b>20<br /> <b>Influences:</b> Knowledge 4, Books 3, Library 2<br /> <b>Ban: </b>Great-Knower cannot share knowledge not getting other in exchange<br /> <b>Bane: </b>Fire made by the wood from first version of Imperial Library<br /> <b>Manifestation: </b>Fetter, Image, Reaching, Shadow Gateway, Twilight Form<br /> <b>Numina</b>: Aggressive Meme, Dement, Mixed Blessing ( Library, Language )*, Pathfinder, Seek, Sign, Telepathy*","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-17T05:02:38-07:00","id":1382123,"title":"","content":"<b>3. <i>Rat-The-Resilient,</i> Lord of the Constantinople Cisterns</b><br /> <br /> <i>Rat-The-Resilient</i> is Lord of Constantinople\u2019s Cisterns Hisil. He is central spirit of underground labyrinth that in later centuries can be called ancient sewers. He started his existence when first rat from Justinian Plague died under the New Rome in year 541 AD, bringing Black Death to the City. He survived, like his physical originals, all the plagues, hunts and even invasion of cats on the streets to fight the disease. He ate his brothers and sisters, rising in power and intelligence. Now it\u2019s gigantic rat, same in size as typical human, with some catchy paws. All his motivation is to survive. On the other paw, he supports Beshilu nest in other taking of Cisterns and gnawing Gauntlet.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9vGs2Q8.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Rank:</b> 4 (Spirit \u2013 <i>Ensah</i>)<br /> <b>Umia:</b> Animals<br /> <b>Ilthum:</b> Rats ( Vermins )<br /> Power 8, Finesse 10, Resistance 12<br /> <b>Willpower:</b> 10<br /> <b>Essence:</b> 25<br /> <b>Initiative:</b> 22<br /> <b>Defence:</b> 8<br /> <b>Speed:</b> 11<br /> <b>Size:</b> 5<br /> <b>Corpus: </b>17<br /> <b>Influences:</b> Rats 4, Resilience 3, Diseases 2<br /> <b>Ban: </b>Cannot show weakness in his survival<br /> <b>Bane: </b>Corpses of first rat that died from Justinian Plague ( 541AD ) in Constantinople<br /> <b>Manifestation:</b> Discorporate, Gauntlet Breach, Reaching, Twilight Form<br /> <b>Numina</b>: Bane Sense*, Blight*, Drain, Entropic Decay, Implant Mission, Plague Bearer*, Regenerate","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-14T07:17:04-07:00","id":1481067,"title":"","content":"<b>4.The Changing Mantle</b><br /> The most powerful spirit on Burnt Hill was once a spirit of the forest. When white settlers came and brought their industry, the forest succumbed to clearcutting and fire. In desperation, the spirit fought the new rivals and consumed many, becoming a magath. Over the decades, a steady supply of stablilized Essence has ameliorated the worst of the madness, but even so, The Changing Mantle is feared, for it is utterly unpredictable; nurtures one moment and destroys the next. Several minor spirits have been granted protection, only to have their benefactor turn on them.<br /> <br /> <b>Rank</b> 4 (Spirit *\u2013 <i>Ensah</i>)<br /> <b>Magath </b>(Forest and Change)<br /> Power 10, Finesse 9, Resistance 12<br /> <b>Willpower</b> 10<br /> <b>Essence</b> 25<br /> <b>Initiative</b> 21<br /> <b>Defence</b> 9<br /> <b>Speed</b> 19<br /> <b>Size </b>6<br /> <b>Corpus</b> 16<br /> <b>Influence:</b> Fire 1, Forest 3<br /> <b>Ban:</b> Must effect some change in the physical world every month, or lose all willpower.<br /> <b>Bane: </b>An axhead made of stone lashed to a branch of a tree untouched by fire for 200 years.<br /> <b>Manifestation: </b>Twilight Form, Reaching, Gauntlet Breach, Materialize<br /> <b>Numina: </b>Awe, Blast (fire), Firestarter, Regenerate<br /> <b>Description:</b> The Changing Mantle appears as a vaguely humanoid mass of stone and earth, moving on sturdy taproots, with a back covered in miniature trees and undergrowth. Flame sweeps across its back, charring all growth; the growth springs anew in moments. At the end of one arm is a double-bitted axe blade.<br /> <b>Notes:</b> Damage from the blade is lethal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2203,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2203-corrigan","user":"Corrigan","date":". 05-14-2022, 10:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2203-corrigan","name":"Corrigan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"189"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-09-15T17:29:23-07:00","id":1542209,"title":"","content":"<b>5. KPX</b><br /> <br /> KPX is a completely artificial spirit, in the sense that it did not appear naturally, but it was created by forcefully mixing diverse resonances associated to computing and finance to create a subservient being. It lookes like a silvered sphere with flashing currency symbols on its surface.<br /> <br /> <b>Rank:</b> 1<br /> <b>Attributes:</b> Power 2, Finesse 2, Resistance 1<br /> <b>Willpower:</b> 3<br /> <b>Essence:</b> 5<br /> <b>Initiative: </b>3<br /> <b>Defense:</b> 2<br /> <b>Speed:</b> 13<br /> <b>Size:</b> 3<br /> <b>Corpus:</b> 4<br /> <b>Influences:</b> Computers 1, Money 1<br /> <b>Manifestations:</b> Twilight Form, Fetter<br /> <b>Numina:</b> Left-Handed Spanner; 1 Numen exchanged for an Influence dot<br /> <b>Ban:</b> Must offer financial or computer advice to anyone who asks.<br /> <b>Bane:</b> Physical currency of any kind.<br /> <b>Conditions: </b>Fettered (Server)<br /> <br /> See <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1320203-the-pack-101-packs?p=1458932#post1458932\">here </a>as a Totem and its pack.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 09-15-2024, 08:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-09-15T17:33:16-07:00","id":1542210,"title":"","content":"<b>6. Zia, Overwhelming Passion</b><br /> <br /> Zia was born of the indulgence of the elite, but it became quite damaging to the humans in the sex-club that it used to inhabit. Brought to heel by the Alpha of a Storm Lord pack that was wiped out by conflict with the Pure, it survived the pack's destruction by possessing a human host.<br /> <br /> Zia is a pink-reddish translucent bulge of flesh contorted in vaguely suggestive shapes, but can produce male or female genitalia at will.<br /> <br /> <b>Rank:</b> 3<br /> <b>Attributes:</b> Power 8, Finesse 8, Resistance 5<br /> <b>Willpower:</b> 10<br /> <b>Essence:</b> 20<br /> <b>Initiative: </b>13<br /> <b>Defense:</b> 8<br /> <b>Speed:</b> 21<br /> <b>Size:</b> 5<br /> <b>Corpus:</b> 10<br /> <b>Influences:</b> Lust 3<br /> <b>Manifestations:</b> Twilight Form, Gauntlet Breach, Possess, Claim<br /> <b>Numina:</b> Aggressive Meme, Drain, Emotional Aura, Host Jump, Implant Mission, Rapture<br /> <b>Ban:</b> Zia must be in the presence of someone indulging in lust every 24 hours, otherwise it becomes morose and lethargic losing it\u2019s defense.<br /> <b>Bane:</b> A human that has been voluntarily celibate for a year.<br /> <br /> See <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1320203-the-pack-101-packs?p=1348517#post1348517\">here </a>as a Totem, its pack and associated Mystery Cult.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 09-16-2024, 09:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-09-15T17:42:25-07:00","id":1542211,"title":"","content":"<b>7. Palisades, Prosperity Through Commerce</b><br /> <br /> This is the spirit of the oldest and one of the largest malls in the city. The adjacent high income neighborhoods grew around the mall as part of the effect of its construction. It has been working with a Pack for over 40 years.<br /> <br /> A perpetually smiling attractive female made of white plaster dressed in professional attire mounted on (and merged with) a Segway, they have a blinking earpiece, the mall logo instead of irises and every so often they incite the interlocutor to acquire wares or services from the mall.<br /> <br /> <b>Rank</b>: 3<br /> <b>Attributes</b>: Power 6, Finesse 9, Resistance 6<br /> <b>Willpower</b>: 10<br /> <b>Essence</b>: 20<br /> <b>Initiative</b>: 15<br /> <b>Defense</b>: 6<br /> <b>Speed:</b> 20<br /> <b>Size:</b> 5<br /> <b>Corpus:</b> 11<br /> <b>Influences:</b> Commerce 5<br /> <b>Manifestations</b>: Twilight Form, Discorporate, Reaching, Shadow Gateway<br /> <b>Numina</b>: Drain, Innocuous, Pathfinder, Seek; 2 Numina exchanged for Influence dots<br /> <b>Ban</b>: Palisades must must ensure that all advertising and promotions related to the mall remain upbeat and appealing.<br /> <b>Bane</b>: Obsolete commercial media. This includes, but is not limited to, physical objects like old-fashioned advertising materials (e.g., vintage billboards or brochures), obsolete technology (like old cash registers or outdated mall directories), or even digital artifacts representing past commercial trends.<br /> <br /> See <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1320203-the-pack-101-packs?p=1523120#post1523120\">here </a>as a Totem and its pack.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 10-07-2024, 01:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-09-15T17:46:17-07:00","id":1542212,"title":"","content":"<b>8. Tui, Pushing Moon &amp; La, Pulling Ocean</b><br /> <br /> Reportedly &quot;near the beginning of time&quot;, Tui and La chose to manifest themselves in the mortal world to benefit mankind and took up residence together as koi fish in a locus, the Spirit Oasis. They look like a white koi fish with a large black spot on its head (Tui) and a black koi fish with a large white spot on its head (La).<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Tui</b><br /> <b>Rank</b>: 3<br /> <b>Attributes</b>: Power 9, Finesse 9, Resistance 3<br /> <b>Willpower</b>: 10<br /> <b>Essence</b>: 20<br /> <b>Initiative</b>: 12<br /> <b>Defense</b>: 9<br /> <b>Speed:</b> 18 ground / 28 swim<br /> <b>Size:</b> 3<br /> <b>Corpus:</b> 6<br /> <b>Influences:</b> Health 2, Ice 1, Moonlight 3, Water 3<br /> <b>Manifestations</b>: Twilight Form, Fetter, Possess, Claim<br /> <b>Numina</b>: 6 Numina exchanged for Influence dots<br /> <b>Ban</b>: Tui must disrupt the pack bond during a lunar eclipse, the pack loses access to the totem and any advantages during this time. Tui can only accept descendants of the Water tribe as members of the pack.<br /> <b>Bane</b>: Fire created by supernatural sources.<br /> <b>Conditions: </b>Fettered (Spirit Oasis)\u200b\u200b<br /> <br /> <b>La</b><br /> <b>Rank</b>: 3<br /> <b>Attributes</b>: Power 9, Finesse 9, Resistance 3<br /> <b>Willpower</b>: 10<br /> <b>Essence</b>: 20<br /> <b>Initiative</b>: 12<br /> <b>Defense</b>: 9<br /> <b>Speed:</b> 18 ground / 28 swim<br /> <b>Size:</b> 3<br /> <b>Corpus:</b> 6<br /> <b>Influences:</b> Light 1, Ice 2, Tides 3, Water 3<br /> <b>Manifestations</b>: Twilight Form, Fetter, Possess, Claim<br /> <b>Numina</b>: 6 Numina exchanged for Influence dots<br /> <b>Ban</b>: La can only claim live humans with a supernatural template.<br /> <b>Bane</b>: Fire created by supernatural sources.\u200b<br /> <b>Conditions: </b>Fettered (Spirit Oasis)\u200b\u200b<br /> <br /> <br /> See <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1320203-the-pack-101-packs?p=1523157#post1523157\">here </a>as a Totem, a companion Spirit and their pack.\u200b\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 09-15-2024, 09:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-09-15T17:53:08-07:00","id":1542213,"title":"","content":"<b>9. Raya, Spirit Familiar</b><br /> <br /> This is a Familiar to a Mage, a Spirit birthed and molded to provide a role.<br /> <br /> Raya\u2019s primary form is that of a graceful, semi-translucent bird-like figure with subtle hues of blue and green.<br /> <br /> <b>Rank:</b> 2<br /> <b>Attributes: </b>Power 4, Finesse 5, Resistance 5<br /> <b>Willpower:</b> 10<br /> <b>Essence:</b> 15<br /> <b>Initiative: </b>10<br /> <b>Defense:</b> 4<br /> <b>Speed:</b> 19<br /> <b>Size: </b>5<br /> <b>Corpus:</b> 10<br /> <b>Influences:</b> Healing 2, Protection 2<br /> <b>Manifestations:</b> Familiar, Discorporate, Image, Twilight Form<br /> <b>Numina:</b> Innocuous, Regenerate, Speed; 2 Numina exchanged for Influence dots<br /> <b>Ban: </b>Raya must actively provide comfort and protection to those in distress.<br /> <b>Bane:</b> Toxic waste.<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Familiar (Mage)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 09-15-2024, 08:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}